<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amaprop details capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>Amaprop details capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Properties Ltd said on Monday shareholders would be offered capitalisation shares based on the ratio that 10.75 cents bears to the average share price on the three days to December 23.</p>
<p>Shareholders may elect to receive a cash interim dividend of 10 cents instead.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
